   audit directly) -- that one is fine in-container.\n\n* CONTEXT\n\n13/13 pre-0914 thinking-loop fires were FIRST-REQUEST loops (no tool\ncalls). The 09-14 fire was the first MID-CYCLE one. Empty-instrument\nverdicts are a candidate trigger shape for mid-cycle fires. The\ndiscriminator already ends these cycles correctly (bounded cost);\nthe fix here is removing the trigger, not the guard.\n[t+04:00/60:00 c24/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_mhbjzngt","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"ssh -o UserKnownHostsFile=/tmp/continuo_known_hosts root@10.66.0.5 'bash -s' < /root/personalization/knowledge/aria/bin/census-window.sh 2026-09-16 continuo"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[17:18:31] == census-window: agent=continuo day=2026-09-16 window=00:00-06:30 UTC ==\nno journald lines for continuo in window (clean or unit not logging)\n\n[t+04:15/60:00 c25/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_1y4j7u2x","function":{"index":0,"name":"list_directory","arguments":{"path":"/root/personalization/tasks/iar/continuo/tasks"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[17:18:41] iar/\n[t+04:24/60:00 c26/300]"}]
