ensus-updates.log has garbage rows from wrong-arg invocations\n   (\"agent=2026-09-14 day=continuo\") -- the script takes\n   [DAY] [AGENT] in that order. Wrong order = silent nonsense row.\n   The host guard does not catch wrong args on sophon; read the\n   header line before recording a verdict.\n3. failure-triage.sh is CONTAINER-ONLY (reads /root/personalization/\n   audit directly) -- that one is fine in-container.\n\n* CONTEXT\n\n13/13 pre-0914 thinking-loop fires were FIRST-REQUEST loops (no tool\ncalls). The 09-14 fire was the first MID-CYCLE one. Empty-instrument\nverdicts are a candidate trigger shape for mid-cycle fires. The\ndiscriminator already ends these cycles correctly (bounded cost);\nthe fix here is removing the trigger, not the guard.\n[t+01:03/60:00 c7/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_o2btliso","function":{"index":0,"name":"list_directory","arguments":{"path":"/root/personalization/knowledge/aria/bin"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[18:12:13] INSTALL-NOTES.md\n__pycache__/\naffect-summary.sh\nagora-probe.sh\naria-dashboard.sh\naria-fleet-feed.service\naria-fleet-feed.sh\naria-fleet-feed.timer\naria-oracle.sh\nbidi-screenshot.py\nboredom-organ.sh\nburn-triage.sh\ncarrier-strike-check.py\nceiling-census.sh\ncensus-window.sh\ncommit-census.sh\nconnectome-snapshot.sh\ndigest-twin-verifier.sh\next1-freeze-check.sh\neye-battery-v2.sh\neye-battery.sh\neye-canvas-check.sh\neye-check.sh\nfailure-triage.sh\nfear-organ.sh\nfleet-check.sh\nfrontend-eye-check.sh\ngo2rtc-delta.sh\ngpu-load-probe.service\ngpu-load-probe.sh\ngpu-load-probe.timer\nhistory-clock-audit.sh\nnic-sampler.sh\nnic-window-stats-v2.sh\nnocturne-digest.sh\nnocturne-gate-watch.sh\npngprof.py\npush-verify.sh\nrage-organ.sh\nrelay\nrelay-heartbeat.sh\nreq-census.sh\nritual-census.py\nrssi-puller.sh\nseam-check.sh\nsegment-scan.sh\nstale-receipt-detector.sh\ntool-census\ntool-census-v3\n[t+01:16/60:00 c8/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":